            "review_title": "Review at Ngon Hai Dang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Wanderer22506665347\n2 contributions\n0\nToo bad\nMar 2024 • Friends\nI visited the restaurant yesterday. My table mainly drank, so I only ordered a few dishes. Personally, I think the food is not delicious, the preparation is slow. And one thing I'm very upset about is that we rented candy speakers for about 2 hours and the shop charged 500k. Before the performance, I asked for the price but he brought out the speaker and said he didn't know, he was just giving me a ride. Why are you cutting so fiercely? I plan to take it once and then close the shop or something. Never come here again\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten March 30, 2024",
